  "releaseNotes": "PeerSharp.WebTorrent 3.0 targets PeerSharp 3.0 and carries its intentional interface-breaking changes. WebTorrent startup, tracker connection, initial offer generation, stopped announces, and disposal now run independent work concurrently; partial startup and connection failures clean up deterministically; cancellation and background-task faults are observed; and tracker/peer diagnostics remain available during reconnect and shutdown. The package now includes XML documentation and a Source Link symbol package.",
